# Runtime data — THIS PROJECT's local scan ledger, never publish.
# Scoped precisely rather than ignoring data/ wholesale, because upstream
# tracks data/mock_broker/* as part of its broker demo and those files are
# meant to ship with the repository.
/data/liquidity.db
/data/liquidity.db-shm
/data/liquidity.db-wal
